('6.06a', 'Generate a sequence by spotting a pattern or using a term-to-term rule… Find a position-to-term rule for simple arithmetic sequences, algebraically or in words… [DfE A23, A25]'),
('8.03a', 'Know and use the sum of the angles at a point is 360°. [DfE G3, G6]'),
