('8.03d', 'Derive and use the sum of the interior angles of a triangle is 180°. [DfE G3, G6]'),
('10.01a', 'Use and convert standard units of measurement for length, area, volume/capacity, mass, time and money. [DfE N13, R1, G14]'),
('10.01b', 'Use and convert simple compound units (e.g. for speed, rates of pay, unit pricing). Know and apply in simple cases: speed = distance ÷ time… [DfE N13, R1, R11, G14]'),
